# This directory is //go:embed'd by server.go, but its contents are
# generated by `npm run build` in ../frontend (see ../frontend/vite.config.js's
# outDir) -- not checked in, so a stale build can never ship instead of a
# real one. .gitkeep keeps the directory itself present on a fresh
# checkout, since go:embed fails to compile if it's missing outright.
#
# That alone isn't enough, though: go:embed's default directory pattern
# also excludes dotfiles, so a fresh checkout -- which has only .gitkeep
# and .gitignore here -- embeds zero files and `go build` fails outright,
# not just at run time. placeholder.html is tracked for exactly that
# case: a non-dotfile so the embed pattern has something to match. It
# can never ship in place of a real build, because `make frontend` (the
# prerequisite for `make build`/`test`/`vet`, and for the container
# build) deletes everything here except .gitignore and .gitkeep before
# running `npm run build` -- this file included.
*
!.gitignore
!.gitkeep
!placeholder.html
